## User

The last element of a list, or the given default when the list is empty.

## Type

type
```agda
lastOr : ℕ → List ℕ → ℕ
```

## Term

```agda
lastOr zero [] = zero
lastOr zero (x ∷ xs) = x
lastOr (suc n) (x ∷ xs) = lastOr n xs
```

## agda

```agda
lastOr' : ℕ → List ℕ → ℕ
```

## agda

```agda
lastOr' zero [] = zero
lastOr' zero (x ∷ xs) = x
lastOr' (suc n) (x ∷ xs) = lastOr' n xs
```

## agda

```agda
lastOr'' : ℕ → List ℕ → ℕ
```

## agda

```agda
lastOr'' zero [] = zero
lastOr'' zero (x ∷ xs) = x
lastOr'' (suc n) (x ∷ xs) = last
